  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>Patent leather, synthetic, and mesh upper offers a premium look and feel\nWavy lines and classic Air Max 95 visuals for OG style\nReflective design lines enhance visibility in low-light conditions\nFoam midsole delivers cushioned support\nVisible Air in the heel and forefoot offer lasting comfort\nUnique lacing system with nylon eye stays secures the fit\nWaffle and flex grooves on the outsole enhance durability and traction across surfaces\nThe Nike Air Max 95 Big Bubble is imported.\nTake on the city with classic throwback charm when you lace up a pair of these Women's Nike Air Max 95 Big Bubble Casual Shoes. This iteration of the AM95 is crafted with a premium mixed material upper and features distinctively wavy design lines, plush visible Air cushioning, and the reinstated big bubble—a heritage-centric Swoosh silhouette with enormous energy.</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's Nike Air Max 95 Big Bubble Casual Shoes</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Sizing Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Adult</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Black/Light Charcoal/Metallic Gold/Sail</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>3498201</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n